ions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Labour Compliance"},{"text":"Corporate Compliance"},{"text":"Risk Management"},{"text":"A combination of LL.M. Labour/Employment Law + practical HR exposure can be particularly useful for a legal-specialist pathway."}]}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"1. Employment Contracts"},{"type":"p","text":"Specialize in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Appointment agreements"},{"text":"Executive contracts"},{"text":"Consultant agreements"},{"text":"Employment policies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Labour Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Statutory compliance"},{"text":"Audits"},{"text":"Inspections"},{"text":"Labour records"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Employee Relations"},{"type":"p","text":"Handle:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Grievances"},{"text":"Discipline"},{"text":"Workplace disputes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Workplace Investigations"},{"type":"p","text":"Specialize in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Misconduct"},{"text":"Harassment"},{"text":"Ethics investigations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. HR Privacy & Data"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Employee data"},{"text":"HR systems"},{"text":"Data protection"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. Employment Litigation"},{"type":"p","text":"Support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Labour disputes"},{"text":"Employment claims"},{"text":"Legal notices"},{"text":"Litigation strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"7. Global Employment Law"},{"type":"p","text":"Work with multinational organizations on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cross-border workforce issues"},{"text":"Global HR policies"},{"text":"Local employment requirements"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Legal / HR Intern","HR Legal Analyst / Legal Executive","Employment Law Associate","HR Legal Advisor","Senior HR Le